# M4UM – Made For You Music
## Complete Full-Stack Business Website, Customer Portal and Admin Management System

You are building a complete, production-oriented full-stack web application for **M4UM – Made For You Music**, a personalised songwriting and digital music gift business based in Aotearoa New Zealand.

This is a complete business application, NOT a static website, landing page, visual prototype, demonstration or collection of mockups.

Build a real, functional application with:
- A beautiful public-facing business website.
- Customer registration and login.
- A complete personalised song ordering system.
- Persistent database storage.
- A secure customer dashboard.
- A comprehensive private admin dashboard.
- Order management and production workflows.
- Lyric writing, revision and approval functionality.
- Secure file uploads and digital delivery.
- Customer notifications.
- Payment integration architecture.
- Analytics and business reporting.

Every feature must be implemented with real functionality wherever technically possible.

Do not simply create buttons that look functional. Every interactive element must perform its intended action.

